### Analytics dashboard
GET {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/analytics
Accept: application/json

###

### Cart regression checks — run in order (resets shared demo data)
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/config/site-type
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "siteType": "Electronics"
}

### Add first variant — 200, quantity 2
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "variantId": 1, "quantity": 2}

### Add second variant — 200, a separate line with quantity 1
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "variantId": 2, "quantity": 1}

### Update second variant — 200, variant 1 stays at 2; variant 2 becomes 3
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"variantId": 2, "quantity": 3}

### Missing variant does not target another line — 404
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 1}

### Invalid variant — 400, cart unchanged
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "variantId": 999999, "quantity": 1}

### Non-positive addition — 400, cart unchanged (also try quantity -1)
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "variantId": 1, "quantity": 0}

### Excessive addition — 400, no integer overflow or cart mutation
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "variantId": 1, "quantity": 2147483647}

### Stock shared across variants — 400 (product 1 stock is 15; total would be 17)
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"variantId": 2, "quantity": 15}

### Negative update — 400, cart unchanged
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"variantId": 2, "quantity": -1}

### Fetch the authoritative warranty offer
GET {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/cross-sell

### Untrusted warranty fields are ignored — 200, price/name match the offer above
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/warranty
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "warrantyName": "Untrusted name", "warrantyPrice": -100}

### Duplicate warranty — 200, still only one line with productId -1 and quantity 1
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/warranty
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1}

### Warranty quantity cannot increase — 400, cart unchanged
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 2}

### Remove second variant — 200, variant 1 and its warranty remain
DELETE {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1?variantId=2

### Zero removes the last product line and its warranty — 200, empty cart
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"variantId": 1, "quantity": 0}

### Warranty without its product — 400, cart stays empty
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/warranty
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1}

### Complementary offer without trigger — 400, cart unchanged
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/cross-sell
Content-Type: application/json

{"triggerProductId": 1}

### Add trigger for authoritative complementary offer — 200
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 1}

### Add authoritative complementary offer — 200, discounted line has offerTriggerProductId/discountPercent/regularUnitPrice
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/cross-sell
Content-Type: application/json

{"triggerProductId": 1}

### Remove trigger — 200, discounted complementary line reverts to regular catalogue/promo price
DELETE {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1

### Clear reverted complementary line before classic checks
DELETE {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart

### Non-variant addition remains supported — 200
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 1}

### Non-variant update remains supported — 200, quantity 2
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 2}

### Non-variant removal remains supported — 200, empty cart
DELETE {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart/items/1

### ─── Recipe basket regression checks (resets shared demo data) ────────────────
### Select Grocery before the following checks
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/config/site-type
Content-Type: application/json

{"siteType": "Grocery"}

### Options — seven default suggestions; available=false without Foundry configuration
GET {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/options

### Empty recipe — 400, cart unchanged
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipe": "   ", "servings": 4, "brandPreference": "Mix"}

### Invalid party size — 400 (also check 0 and 21), cart unchanged
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipe": "Lasagnes", "servings": -1, "brandPreference": "Mix"}

### Invalid preference — 400, cart unchanged
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipe": "Lasagnes", "servings": 4, "brandPreference": "Unknown"}

### Unknown plan — rejected, cart unchanged
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{"planId": "00000000000000000000000000000000"}

### Plan — 503 without Foundry; with deployed agents: 200, cart STILL empty
### Inspect ingredient coverage, whole pack quantities, expiry and authoritative total.
### Repeat with National, PrivateLabel, Economy, Mix and 1/4/20 servings.
### Explicit ranges must not silently substitute another range.
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipe": "Lasagnes", "servings": 4, "brandPreference": "PrivateLabel"}

### Confirm that generation did not mutate the cart
GET {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart

### Replace with the returned planId, then run TWICE — only one addition
@recipePlanId = replace-with-returned-plan-id
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{"planId": "{{recipePlanId}}"}

### Verify quantities, variants and total after confirmation
GET {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/cart

### Reset invalidates pending plans — subsequent confirmation must not add anything
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/config/reset

###
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/commit
Content-Type: application/json

{"planId": "{{recipePlanId}}"}

### Recipe basket is unavailable in other shops
PUT {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/config/site-type
Content-Type: application/json

{"siteType": "Electronics"}

###
POST {{Zava.Api_HostAddress}}/api/recipe-basket/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipe": "Lasagnes", "servings": 4, "brandPreference": "Mix"}
